      "judgment": "The changed selector is a behavior change to historical ordinary MDC form-field Sass, not a missing source import or current component implementation. Preserve the whole tagged host-hover helper after only the two recorded module relocations. All four complete configurable outputs equal the untouched tagged CSS plus the independently compiled finite three-token insertion; rehashed wrapper-hover and unrelated-rule mutations fail. The public minimum component structural wrapper selector is already present, while legacy-form-field selectors and DOM are separate. No selector, palette, namespace binding, map or golden is changed."
    }
